      "message": "are you certain these are correct?\n\nd74bad4e74ee3 (Andrey Ignatov          2018-03-30 15:08:05 -0700 1072)  BPF_CGROUP_INET4_CONNECT,\nd74bad4e74ee3 (Andrey Ignatov          2018-03-30 15:08:05 -0700 1073)  BPF_CGROUP_INET6_CONNECT,\n\n$ git describe d74bad4e74ee3\nv4.16-rc6-1553-gd74bad4e74ee\n\n1cedee13d25ab (Andrey Ignatov          2018-05-25 08:55:23 -0700 1076)  BPF_CGROUP_UDP4_SENDMSG,\n1cedee13d25ab (Andrey Ignatov          2018-05-25 08:55:23 -0700 1077)  BPF_CGROUP_UDP6_SENDMSG,\n\ngit describe 1cedee13d25ab\nv4.17-rc6-1953-g1cedee13d25a\n\n983695fa67656 (Daniel Borkmann         2019-06-07 01:48:57 +0200 1081)  BPF_CGROUP_UDP4_RECVMSG,\n983695fa67656 (Daniel Borkmann         2019-06-07 01:48:57 +0200 1082)  BPF_CGROUP_UDP6_RECVMSG,\n\ngit describe 983695fa67656\nv5.2-rc1-132-g983695fa6765",
